        spec: "Took property of {V}, valued at $260, on {DATE}.",
        ages: 18...60,
        victim: true,
        summary: "{V} had six inflatable holiday decorations plugged in on the front lawn on {DATE}. At 3 a.m. {D}, who lives across the street, unplugged them, deflated them and carried them across the street in two trash bags. {V} found bare stakes at 7 a.m. and checked the doorbell camera. {D} says {D.he} was moving them to {V}'s backyard to be helpful.",
